WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.723
Unit twenty-three. Healthy Snacks!

2
00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:09.042
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:09.092 --> 00:00:12.625
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.675 --> 00:00:16.719
Today we learn about Healthy Snacks. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.671 --> 00:00:20.821
Fruit. Say it with me. Fruit!

6
00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:27.880
Banana. Say it with me. Banana!

7
00:00:31.383 --> 00:00:34.633
Mango. Say it with me. Mango!

8
00:00:38.132 --> 00:00:41.299
Nuts. Say it with me. Nuts!

9
00:00:44.787 --> 00:00:48.304
Yogurt. Say it with me. Yogurt!

10
00:00:51.823 --> 00:00:55.306
Candy. Say it with me. Candy!

11
00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:02.407
Snack. Say it with me. Snack!

12
00:01:05.909 --> 00:01:09.359
Healthy. Say it with me. Healthy!

13
00:01:12.845 --> 00:01:22.628
A healthy snack like a banana, mango, nuts, or yogurt gives me energy. Candy has lots of sugar, so I eat it only sometimes. Fruit is a sweet and healthy choice.

14
00:01:22.678 --> 00:01:23.916
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.188 --> 00:01:30.327
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.377 --> 00:01:31.527
Mango!

17
00:01:32.609 --> 00:01:37.744
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.794 --> 00:01:38.944
Snack!

19
00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:46.334
Did you know? Fruit has natural sugar plus vitamins and fiber that candy does not have!

20
00:01:46.384 --> 00:01:48.300
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.995 --> 00:01:56.632
Think and answer. What is your favorite healthy snack?

22
00:01:56.682 --> 00:01:57.832
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.999 --> 00:02:04.230
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:07.067
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

